    "[Suggest a source](https://github.com/GETAccretion/getaccretion.github.io/issues/new?template=add-source.yml) to have it added to Accretion and featured here." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[اقتراح مصدر](https://github.com/GETAccretion/getaccretion.github.io/issues/new?template=add-source.yml) ليتم إضافته إلى Accretion وعرضه هنا."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[Navrhnout zdroj](https://github.com/GETAccretion/getaccretion.github.io/issues/new?template=add-source.yml) aby byl přidán do Accretion a zobrazován zde."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[Quelle vorschlagen](https://github.com/GETAccretion/getaccretion.github.io/issues/new?template=add-source.yml), damit sie zu Accretion hinzugefügt und hier vorgestellt wird."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[Sugerir una fuente](https://github.com/GETAccretion/getaccretion.github.io/issues/new?template=add-source.yml) para que se añada a Accretion y se destaque aquí."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[Proposer une source](https://github.com/GETAccretion/getaccretion.github.io/issues/new?template=add-source.yml) pour l'ajouter à Accretion et la mettre en avant ici."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[Usulkan Sumber](https://github.com/GETAccretion/getaccretion.github.io/issues/new?template=add-source.yml) agar ditambahkan ke Accretion dan ditampilkan di sini."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[Suggerisci una fonte](https://github.com/GETAccretion/getaccretion.github.io/issues/new?template=add-source.yml) per farlo aggiungere ad Accretion e mostrarlo qui."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[소스 제안하기](https://github.com/GETAccretion/getaccretion.github.io/issues/new?template=add-source.yml)하여 Accretion에 추가되어 여기에 추천되게 하세요."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[Zaproponuj źródło](https://github.com/GETAccretion/getaccretion.github.io/issues/new?template=add-source.yml), aby zostało dodane do Accretion i wystawione tutaj."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[Предложить источник](https://github.com/GETAccretion/getaccretion.github.io/issues/new?template=add-source.yml), чтобы добавить его в Accretion и отобразить здесь."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[Kaynak önerin](https://github.com/GETAccretion/getaccretion.github.io/issues/new?template=add-source.yml) ki Accretion'a eklensin ve burada öne çıksın."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[Đề xuất nguồn](https://github.com/GETAccretion/getaccretion.github.io/issues/new?template=add-source.yml) để nó được thêm vào Accretion và hiển thị nổi bật tại đây."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[建议软件源](https://github.com/GETAccretion/getaccretion.github.io/issues/new?template=add-source.yml)以便将其添加到 Accretion 并在此处推荐。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
