    "Built by Accretion from a free or open-source app. Unsigned: sign it with your own tool. Source and build scripts: [AccretionMods/mods](https://github.com/AccretionMods/mods)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تم الإنشاء بواسطة Accretion من تطبيق مجاني أو مفتوح المصدر. غير موقع: وقّعه بأداتك الخاصة. المصدر وسكريبتات الإنشاء: [AccretionMods/mods](https://github.com/AccretionMods/mods)."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vytvořeno Accretion z bezplatné nebo open-source aplikace. Nepodepsané: podepište je svým vlastním nástrojem. Zdroj a build skripty: [AccretionMods/mods](https://github.com/AccretionMods/mods)."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Entwickelt von Accretion aus einer kostenlosen oder Open-Source-App. Unsigniert: signieren Sie es mit Ihrem eigenen Tool. Quellcode und Build-Skripte: [AccretionMods/mods](https://github.com/AccretionMods/mods)."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Creado por Accretion a partir de una app gratuita o de código abierto. Sin firmar: fírmalo con tu propia herramienta. Código fuente y scripts de compilación: [AccretionMods/mods](https://github.com/AccretionMods/mods)."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Construit par Accretion à partir d'une app gratuite ou open-source. Non signée : signez-la avec votre propre outil. Sources et scripts de build : [AccretionMods/mods](https://github.com/AccretionMods/mods)."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dibangun oleh Accretion dari aplikasi gratis atau sumber terbuka. Belum ditandatangani: tandatangani dengan alat Anda sendiri. Sumber dan skrip build: [AccretionMods/mods](https://github.com/AccretionMods/mods)."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Creato da Accretion da un'app gratuita o open-source. Non firmato: firmalo con il tuo strumento. Sorgenti e script di build: [AccretionMods/mods](https://github.com/AccretionMods/mods)."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "무료 또는 오픈소스 앱에서 Accretion이 빌드함. 미서명: 직접 도구로 서명하세요. 소스 및 빌드 스크립트: [AccretionMods/mods](https://github.com/AccretionMods/mods)."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zbudowane przez Accretion z darmowej lub open-source'owej aplikacji. Niepodpisane: podpisz własnym narzędziem. Kod źródłowy i skrypty budowania: [AccretionMods/mods](https://github.com/AccretionMods/mods)."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Собрано Accretion из бесплатного или открытого приложения. Неподписанное: подпишите его своим инструментом. Исходный код и скрипты сборки: [AccretionMods/mods](https://github.com/AccretionMods/mods)."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Accretion tarafından, ücretsiz veya açık kaynak bir uygulamadan derlendi. İmzasız: kendi aracınızla imzalayın. Kaynak ve derleme betikleri: [AccretionMods/mods](https://github.com/AccretionMods/mods)."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Được xây dựng bởi Accretion từ một ứng dụng miễn phí hoặc mã nguồn mở. Chưa ký: hãy ký nó bằng công cụ của bạn. Mã nguồn và kịch bản xây dựng: [AccretionMods/mods](https://github.com/AccretionMods/mods)."
