    "Feather's developers made the app Accretion is based on. They aren't involved in Accretion, so please send Accretion questions to Accretion, not to them." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "صنع مطورو Feather التطبيق الذي يستند إليه Accretion. هم ليسوا مشاركين في Accretion، لذا يرجى إرسال أسئلة Accretion إلى Accretion، وليس إليهم."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vývojáři Feather vytvořili aplikaci, na které Accretion vychází. Nejsou zapojeni do Accretion, proto prosím posílejte dotazy k Accretion přímo Accretion, ne jim."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Feathers Entwickler haben die App erstellt, auf der Accretion basiert. Sie sind nicht an Accretion beteiligt, senden Sie Accretion-Fragen daher an Accretion, nicht an sie."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los desarrolladores de Feather crearon la app en la que se basa Accretion. No participan en Accretion, así que envíen sus preguntas sobre Accretion a Accretion, no a ellos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les développeurs de Feather ont créé l'application sur laquelle Accretion repose. Ils ne participent pas à Accretion, veuillez donc adresser vos questions sur Accretion à Accretion, et non à eux."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pengembang Feather membuat aplikasi yang dijadikan basis Accretion. Mereka tidak terlibat dalam Accretion, jadi kirim pertanyaan seputar Accretion ke Accretion, bukan ke mereka."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gli sviluppatori di Feather hanno creato l'app su cui si basa Accretion. Non sono coinvolti in Accretion, quindi inviate le domande su Accretion ad Accretion, non a loro."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Feather의 개발자들이 Accretion의 기반이 된 앱을 만들었습니다. 그들은 Accretion과 관련이 없으므로, Accretion 관련 질문은 Accretion에 문의해 주세요, 그들에게 하지 마세요."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deweloperzy Feather stworzyli aplikację, na której opiera się Accretion. Nie są oni zaangażowani w Accretion, więc proszę kierować pytania o Accretion do Accretion, a nie do nich."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Разработчики Feather создали приложение, на котором основан Accretion. Они не участвуют в Accretion, поэтому направляйте вопросы по Accretion к Accretion, а не к ним."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Feather geliştiricileri, Accretion'ın dayandığı uygulamayı yaptı. Onlar Accretion ile ilgilenmiyor, bu yüzden Accretion sorularınızı Accretion'a, onlara değil gönderin."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Các nhà phát triển của Feather đã tạo ứng dụng mà Accretion dựa trên. Họ không tham gia vào Accretion, nên hãy gửi câu hỏi về Accretion đến Accretion, không phải đến họ."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Feather 的开发者制作了 Accretion 所基于的应用。他们不参与 Accretion 的开发，因此请将 Accretion 相关问题发送给 Accretion，而非他们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
